OL,3,GNEWSAReport identifies strong case to
OL,4,Areopen train station
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a strong case for proposals to
OL,7,Fbuild a new train station that could
OL,8,Fattract up to 1,400 passengers a day, a
OL,9,Fstudy has found.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council commissioned
OL,12,Fthe a Strategic Outline Case (SOC) into
OL,13,Fthe feasibility of a new station
OL,14,Fserving Wantage and Grove last year.
OL,16,FThe SOC is the first stage in proposing
OL,17,Fa large infrastructure project to the
OL,18,FDepartment for Transport, and said
OL,19,Fthere was a "robust foundation" to
OL,20,Fprogress the plans.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
